  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "We drove him to the station in his own cab, and he came as quiet as a lamb.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "police_inspector",
      "text": "Have you anything to say? It will be taken down.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.667,
      "seconds": 3.61
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "I may never be tried.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 12.0,
      "seconds": 1.62
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I put my hand on his chest. Inside, something throbbed like an engine in a shed.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 15.125,
      "seconds": 5.8
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "You have an aortic aneurism!",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 21.958,
      "seconds": 2.81
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He sat down, and told us the whole of it as calmly as a man reading a timetable.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 26.583,
      "seconds": 5.7
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "For two weeks he had driven behind Drebber and Stangerson, and never once found them apart.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 33.708,
      "seconds": 6.2
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Then at Euston they missed the Liverpool train, and Drebber went off alone into the night.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 40.917,
      "seconds": 6.38
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Hope drove him from one gin palace to the next, until the man could barely stand.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 48.333,
      "seconds": 6.02
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "In his pocket was a little box with two pills in it, and only one was poisoned.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 55.375,
      "seconds": 4.96
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "All the way, John Ferrier and Lucy walked ahead of the horse in the rain, one each side.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 61.375,
      "seconds": 5.61
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "At Brixton Road he woke his passenger, and walked him up the garden to the empty house.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 70.292,
      "seconds": 5.89
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "It was black inside. Hope struck a match, and lit a wax candle he had brought.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 77.208,
      "seconds": 5.82
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Drebber stamped about the dust, grumbling at the dark, and waiting to be shown his room.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 84.042,
      "seconds": 5.75
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "Now then, Enoch Drebber. Look at my face, and tell me who I am.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 91.625,
      "seconds": 4.68
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The drink went out of his eyes, and the horror came into them. He knew.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 97.833,
      "seconds": 5.0
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "enoch_j_drebber",
      "text": "Would you murder me?",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 104.167,
      "seconds": 1.37
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Hope held out the box. Drebber was to choose, and Hope would swallow the pill that was left.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 106.667,
      "seconds": 6.48
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "Let us see if there is justice upon the earth.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 114.167,
      "seconds": 3.26
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "When the poison took hold, Hope held Lucy's wedding ring up before his eyes.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 118.75,
      "seconds": 4.82
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "It was quick. He threw out his hands, and fell, and never moved again.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 124.708,
      "seconds": 4.84
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Stangerson he found two days later, and gave the same choice. The man flew at his throat.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 131.375,
      "seconds": 6.31
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "When he stopped, nobody spoke. There was only the scratch of Lestrade's pencil.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 138.708,
      "seconds": 5.48
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Holmes had one question left: who had come to our rooms for the ring?",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 145.292,
      "seconds": 5.14
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "jefferson_hope",
      "text": "I can tell my own secrets, but not other people's.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 151.458,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "police_inspector",
      "text": "On Thursday he goes before the magistrates. Until then, he is mine.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 156.75,
      "seconds": 4.89
    }
  ]
}